<title>USA: OMAHA CATTLE FIRM - UPDATE - USDA.</title>
<headline>OMAHA CATTLE FIRM - UPDATE - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were fairly active, prices firm. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150-1300 lbs 64.00-65.00, shipment 65.50. Select 61.00-64.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Load reputation fed Choice 1100 lbs 2-4 65.75. Select to mainly Choice 2-4 975-1250 lbs 63.50-65.00. Select 60.00-63.50.</p>
</text>
